    },
    "B": {
      "naturalness": "“Yes—one quiet minute, seated” is concise, comfortable, and responsive.",
      "useful_understanding": "“with no audio or focus on your breathing” accurately acknowledges the constraints, but the output stops short of selecting a matching resource or providing an executable pause.",
      "grounding": "“Wants a one-minute silent seated pause without breath focus” stays within the user’s stated preferences and introduces no specific resource claim.",
